{"availability":"available","full":"SaadH-077/StoryWeaver","name":"StoryWeaver","description":"An immersive, agentic storyteller: a crew of AI agents (LangGraph + FastAPI) writes, voices, paints and scores a 1–3 minute interactive story you can shape by speaking or typing — on free model tiers.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T15:53:09Z","updated":"2026-10-09T07:04:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://storyweaver-virid.vercel.app","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-agents","ai-safety","fastapi","gemini","generative-ai","groq","image-generation","interactive-fiction","langgraph","llm","mcp","multi-agent-systems","python","speech-to-text","storytelling","text-to-speech","vercel","voice-assistant","web-audio"],"demo":"https://storyweaver-virid.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:14.909Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:14.909Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:14.909Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:10.672Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T15:44:14.909Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Tell StoryWeaver what to imagine. A crew of AI agents writes it, gives every character a voice, paints it and scores it — and you shape what happens next, by tapping or by speaking.","StoryWeaver turns a one-line idea (\"a little hedgehog who is afraid of the dark\") into a short narrated, illustrated, interactive story for the listener you choose — little ones, the whole family or grown-ups — sized to the time you have: 1, 2 or 3 minutes. It is a working proof of concept of an agentic storyteller, built to run reliably on free model tiers.","▶ Try it live: storyweaver-virid.vercel.app — runs on free model tiers (if they are busy, StoryWeaver tells one of its own stories rather than fail)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SaadH-077/StoryWeaver/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"